{"agentId": "a9ee02bd616f45378", "cwd": "/home/user/rainbow-", "entrypoint": "remote_mobile", "gitBranch": "claude/rainbow-3d-recovery-m4v347", "isSidechain": true, "message": {"content": [{"content": "# Official cartoon girl — model, rig & animation notes\n\nSpecialist: `cartoon-girl-character-artist`. Identity source: `character_references/official_cartoon_girl_original.jpg`\n(the realistic girls inside references 01 / 10 / 11 are composition references only and were NOT modelled).\nONE model / ONE rig is used for scene 01 (walks away), scene 10 (seen through the door) and scene 11 (leans in,\nhands on the folded purple towel).\n\n| Item | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Builder | `src/characters/girl/build.ts` → `buildGirl(): BuiltModel` (procedural Three.js geometry + canvas textures, no external images) |\n| Textures | `src/characters/girl/textures.ts` (eye, face decal, hoodie stripes, rib knit, denim twill, hair strands) |\n| Runtime | `src/characters/girl/runtime.ts` → `loadGirl(): Promise<GirlRuntime>` |\n| GLB | `assets/models/rainbow_girl.glb` — 3,546,480 bytes, 165 meshes, 194 nodes, **84,820 triangles**, 9 clips |\n| Contract | origin between the feet on the floor, faces **+Z**, up +Y, height ≈ **25.6 units** (≈ 26 incl. ponytail spring) ; her LEFT = +X |\n| Review renders | `docs/characters/girl_turntable.png` (front · ¾ · side · back), `girl_turntable_anim_leanReachTowel_t_1_6.png`, `girl_turntable_anim_walk_t_0_3.png`, `girl_face_closeup_lean_glb.png` (scene-11-like face close-up, loaded from the GLB) |\n| Close-up lab | `src/characters/girl/girl-lab.html?src=glb|build&layout=identity|face|poses&anim=<clip>&t=<s>` |\n\n## Rig (joint hierarchy — rigid parts parented to joints, **not skin-weighted**)\n\n```\ngirl_root\n└ hips ─ thighL ─ shinL ─ footL          (hoodie_skirt, hem, jeans hips/pockets ride the hips)\n  │    └ thighR ─ shinR ─ footR\n  └ spine ─ chest ─ neck ─ head ─ headCenter ─ eyeL/eyeR (eye surface + eyelidL/eyelidR morph meshes)\n          │                              └ ponytail ─ ponytailL / ponytailR / ponytailTip (curl groups)\n          ├ shoulderL ─ upperArmL ─ forearmL ─ handL\n          └ shoulderR ─ upperArmR ─ forearmR ─ handR\n```\n\n* Blinking: `eyelidL` / `eyelidR` are skin-coloured lid meshes sitting just behind the real eye openings in the\n  skull, with a `blink` morph target (0 = open, 1 = closed). The runtime blinks procedurally every 2.2–5.4 s\n  (occasional double blink); the explicit `blink` clip also drives the morph.\n* Eyes: real almond openings are cut into the head mesh (boundary vertices snapped onto the curve) with a\n  face-conforming eye surface behind them — no bulging domes. Gaze is fixed forward (rotating `eyeL/eyeR`\n  would slide the conforming surface; not supported).\n* Material names (for runtime tweaks): `skin`, `lid`, `hair`, `hairLight`, `hairDark`, `eye`, `face`, `hoodie`,\n  `rib`, `collar`, `denim`, `denimLight`, `purple`, `purpleDeep`, `shoe`, `white`, `sole`, `gold`, `starYellow`, `sock`, …\n\n## Clips (24 fps sampled, all body joints keyed in every clip so cross-fades never leave a joint stuck)\n\n----\n# Benny — canonical model, rig & runtime (benny-character-artist)\n\n**One** Benny for every scene: `assets/models/benny.glb` (1.18 MB), built procedurally by\n`src/characters/benny/build.ts` and exported with `node scripts/export-models.mjs benny`\n(Three.js GLTFExporter in headless Chromium). No external assets, no paid generators, no Blender.\nThe game loads it through `loadBenny()` in `src/characters/benny/runtime.ts`.\n\n## Contract\n* Origin = centre of the round body; faces **+Z**, up +Y (so `root.lookAt(pos + tangent)` points him down the course).\n* Skin sphere r = 0.70, fur adds ≈ 0.105 → visual body radius ≈ 0.8 (`BennyRuntime.radius = 0.8`).\n* Height: feet −0.85 → pom top +1.44 ≈ **2.3 units**; width ≈ 1.9 incl. arms.\n\n## Rig (joint nodes, rigid parts parented to joints — not skin-weighted)\n`benny_root › body › { hat › pom, eyes › eyeL / eyeR, mouth, armL, armR, footL, footR }`\n(armL/footL = Benny's left = +X). Blink = cartoon squash of `eyeL/eyeR` (scale.y).\n\n## Animation clips (in the GLB)\n| clip | length | content |\n|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.4 s | gentle bob, arm sway |\n| `swim` | 0.6 s | paws paddle (alternating), feet kick, body bob + roll |\n| `tumble` | 1.0 s | paws flail up, fast kicks (caller spins the root — scene 02) |\n| `peek` | 2.0 s | paws forward/up holding the towel edge, sway (scene 01) |\n\nRuntime blends idle↔swim by `swim`, crossfades tumble/peek, and adds procedural steering lean,\npom-pom spring bounce (vertical acceleration + steer + speed jitter), blinks, and fur wind.\n\n## Expressions\n`setExpression('happy' | 'dizzy' | 'peek')` toggles meshes in the GLB:\n`eye{L,R}_happy` (violet iris, black pupil, 2 sparkles, outer lashes), `eye{L,R}_dizzy` (purple spirals, scene 02),\n----\n# 07 → 08 continuity proof (automated)\n\nGenerated by `node scripts/gameplay-test.mjs` driving the real game build in headless Chromium\n(deterministic 60 Hz simulation, coin-seeking steering). Frames: `qa/continuity/07a…07d.png`\n(`node scripts/capture.mjs --plunge`).\n\n| Point | sim time (s) | Benny altitude |\n|---|---|---|\n| plunge top (end of 07 winding stretch) | 23.70 | -51.849 |\n| plunge bottom (pull-up complete) | 30.28 | -113.244 |\n| 08 inlet (chamber back wall) | 30.28 | -113.244 |\n\n* travel time top → 08 inlet: **6.58 s**; vertical drop: **61.4 units**\n* max camera movement per 1/60 s step over the whole run: **0.748** units (no cuts)\n* max Benny altitude change per step: **0.19** (no teleport)\n* s strictly increasing every step: **true** (2139 steps)\n\n## All checks\n\n* ✅ **pauseFreezes** — {\"sBefore\":45.483,\"sPaused\":45.483,\"sAfter\":49.983}\n* ✅ **continuousTravel** — {\"nonMonotonicSteps\":0,\"steps\":2139,\"respawns\":0}\n* ✅ **noCameraCut** — {\"maxCameraJumpPerStep\":0.748}\n* ✅ **noTeleport** — {\"maxBennyAltitudeJumpPerStep\":0.19,\"at\":{\"s\":360.153,\"s1\":360.353,\"stage\":\"07\",\"y0\":-93.314,\"y1\":-93.504,\"t\":27.867}}\n* ✅ **plunge** — {\"tTop\":23.699999999999935,\"tBottom\":30.283333333332894,\"t08\":30.283333333332894,\"yTop\":-51.849,\"yBottom\":-113.244,\"y08\":-113.244,\"travelTimeTopToInlet\":6.58,\"verticalDrop\":61.4}\n* ✅ **realCoinPickups** — {\"startCoins\":1330,\"endCoins\":2320,\"collected\":99}\n* ✅ **victory** — {}\n* ✅ **heartsLostOnWallBump** — {\"hearts\":3}\n\nPage errors: none\n----\n{\n  \"checks\": {\n    \"pauseFreezes\": {\n      \"pass\": true,\n      \"sBefore\": 45.483,\n      \"sPaused\": 45.483,\n      \"sAfter\": 49.983\n    },\n    \"continuousTravel\": {\n      \"pass\": true,\n      \"nonMonotonicSteps\": 0,\n      \"steps\": 2139,\n      \"respawns\": 0\n    },\n    \"noCameraCut\": {\n      \"pass\": true,\n      \"maxCameraJumpPerStep\": 0.748\n    },\n    \"noTeleport\": {\n      \"pass\": true,\n      \"maxBennyAltitudeJumpPerStep\": 0.19,\n      \"at\": {\n        \"s\": 360.153,\n        \"s1\": 360.353,\n        \"stage\": \"07\",\n        \"y0\": -93.314,\n        \"y1\": -93.504,\n        \"t\": 27.867\n      }\n    },\n    \"plunge\": {\n      \"pass\": true,\n      \"tTop\": 23.699999999999935,\n      \"tBottom\": 30.283333333332894,\n      \"t08\": 30.283333333332894,\n      \"yTop\": -51.849,\n      \"yBottom\": -113.244,\n      \"y08\": -113.244,\n      \"travelTimeTopToInlet\": 6.58,\n      \"verticalDrop\": 61.4", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_018ypsoGZ7VhED6XefKUERRw", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "parentUuid": "aacad143-67ff-4e0c-b49d-0de9b7b26e4d", "permissionDecision": {"decision": "accept", "reasonType": "rule", "ruleSource": "cliArg", "source": "config"}, "promptId": "27f13e08-f819-44de-818d-2b1405af6463", "sandboxed": false, "sessionId": "e0f002d9-e93b-5e8f-89ac-1e3fceebb58f", "sourceToolAssistantUUID": "aacad143-67ff-4e0c-b49d-0de9b7b26e4d", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:45:04.101Z", "type": "user", "userType": "external", "uuid": "3